(DOMINION - Demo Rulebook \(Board Game Cafe\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(OVERVIEW) Tj T*
(Dominion is a deck-building game. Each player starts with a small deck and buys cards) Tj T*
(from the supply to improve it. Victory cards give points at the end but do nothing) Tj T*
(during the game.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SETUP) Tj T*
(The supply has Copper, Silver and Gold, Estates, Duchies and Provinces, Curses and 10) Tj T*
(piles of Kingdom cards. Use 8 of each Victory card with 2 players and 12 with 3 or 4) Tj T*
(players. Each player starts with 7 Coppers and 3 Estates, shuffles them and draws 5) Tj T*
(cards.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(YOUR TURN \(A-B-C\)) Tj T*
(- A, Action phase: you may play 1 Action card. "+Actions" on cards let you play more.) Tj T*
(- B, Buy phase: play Treasures from your hand and buy 1 card with a cost up to their) Tj T*
(   total.) Tj T*
("+Buy" on cards lets you buy more.) Tj T*
(- C, Clean-up: discard all played cards and your hand, then draw 5 new cards.) Tj T*
(When you need to draw and your deck is empty, shuffle your discard pile to form a new) Tj T*
(deck.) Tj T*
ET
