(COSTS AND VALUES) Tj T*
(- Copper: costs 0, gives 1 coin. Silver: costs 3, gives 2. Gold: costs 6, gives 3.) Tj T*
(- Estate: costs 2, worth 1 point. Duchy: costs 5, worth 3. Province: costs 8, worth 6.) Tj T*
(- Curse: worth -1 point; usually given to you by an opponent's attack.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(READING KINGDOM CARDS) Tj T*
("+1 Card" draws a card. "+1 Action" lets you play another Action. "+1 Buy" gives one) Tj T*
(more buy. "+1 coin" adds money for the Buy phase. Attack cards affect the other) Tj T*
(players.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(END OF THE GAME) Tj T*
(The game ends at the end of a turn when the Province pile is empty or when any 3) Tj T*
(supply piles are empty. Count the victory points in your whole deck. The most points) Tj T*
(wins; on a tie, the player who had fewer turns wins.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
